# profile P2 real-world check, 2026-10-08, Mac, scratch prod stack
# Harald's phone number and email address are redacted throughout; his name, city, employers and
# schools are replaced with invented ones (the same invented person as
# api/tests/profile/fixtures/owner_sources).

## Stack
docker compose -p jobapp-p2scratch -f compose.yml -f compose.p2.yml up -d --build --wait
  (compose.p2.yml renames the images to jobapp-p2scratch-{api,caddy}:latest so the shared
  jobapp-api:latest and jobapp-caddy:latest tags are not overwritten; .env: APP_ENV=production,
  HTTP_PORT=8092)
  -> redis, db, api, caddy Healthy
docker compose ... exec -T api alembic upgrade head
  -> 0001, 0002, 0003
docker compose ... exec -T api python -m app.identity.cli create-admin harald.p2check@example.org
  -> setup link printed; accepted with Playwright APIRequestContext: POST
     /api/auth/invites/<token>/accept -> 200 (the account used below is a scratch account, not
     Harald's real email)

## Convert on the Mac (no database)
uv run --native-tls --directory api python -m app.profile.cli convert \
    --source-dir /Users/owner/Desktop/job --out <scratchpad>/harald.json
  -> Wrote <scratchpad>/harald.json: 10 fact blocks, 5 employers, 3 schools, 32 boards, photo included.

## Import inside the api container
docker compose ... cp <scratchpad>/harald.json api:/tmp/harald.json
docker compose ... exec -T api python -m app.profile.cli import --email harald.p2check@example.org --file /tmp/harald.json
  -> Imported the profile of harald.p2check@example.org: revision 6, 100% complete, photo replaced.
docker compose ... exec -T api python -m app.profile.cli import --email harald.p2check@example.org --file - < harald.json
  -> Imported the profile of harald.p2check@example.org: revision 12, 100% complete, photo replaced.
  (the stdin form is the one ./deploy.sh profile import can wrap without docker cp)

